# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Data governance — NOTHING derived from ADNI / OASIS may be committed.
# ADNI and OASIS are distributed under Data Use Agreements that prohibit
# redistribution of subject-level data. The manifests this pipeline generates
# contain OASIS/ADNI subject identifiers alongside CDR, MMSE and diagnosis
# values, and are therefore subject-level data.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.csv
*.tsv
*.json
!.vscode/*.json

# Imaging data and derived tensors
*.nii
*.nii.gz
*.dcm
*.img
*.hdr
*.npy
*.npz
*.mgz

# Model checkpoints and training artefacts
*.pth
*.pt
*.ckpt
*.h5
*.onnx
checkpoints/
runs/
wandb/
lightning_logs/

# Results and figures produced by the pipeline
results/
*_results/
outputs/
*.png
*.pdf
*.svg
!docs/**/*.png

# Local data roots
data/
!data/README.md

